      "writtenOn": "2022-11-16T11:37:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is potentially quite nice. If I do it this way, I still need to upcall to the host to remove the GUP pin. But I avoid a round trip back down to the hypervisor to do this deferred work. Also, arguably, this is more obviously accounted to the VM (assuming page clearing is done here -- which is probably faster than kmap_atomic\u0027s in the guest?).\n\nIt feels like a separate CL however. But one I\u0027m happy to do.",
